[PrintTextModified Text:在场的所有人，立刻朝着四面八方惊惶逃窜。|#0201Bad02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那残酷至极的景象还历历在目。<br>那无法抗衡的、压倒性的力量。<br>一种源自本能的恐惧攫住了心脏。|#0201Bad02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！等等我……|#0201Bad02_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，快点跟上！|#0201Bad02_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我下意识地抓住她伸来的手，<br>拼尽全力向前跑去。|#0201Bad02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

