[PrintTextModified Text:我能清楚地看见，她那异常伸长的指甲，<br>深深贯穿了诺亚的身体。|#0201Bad02_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从那伤口处，无数鲜红的蝴蝶仿佛涌泉一般，<br>翩跹飞舞。|#0201Bad02_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆辛そうに

[PrintTextModified Text:……诺亚……|#0201Bad02_Hiro032| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么……）|#0201Bad02_Hiro033| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明应该没有被发现才对。|#0201Bad02_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们移动时没有发出任何声音，<br>身影也绝对没有被她看见才对。|#0201Bad02_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是——|#0201Bad02_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（难道是……千里眼……？）|#0201Bad02_Hiro034| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可的魔法是千里眼。<br>据说她能看见正在看着她的人。|#0201Bad02_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但如果这个魔法因为魔女化而得到了强化……<br>变成了即使不去看她，她也能将一切尽收眼底的话……|#0201Bad02_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:光是这个想法，就让我脊背发凉。|#0201Bad02_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（必须逃走……！）|#0201Bad02_Hiro035| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，又能逃往哪里？|#0201Bad02_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论逃到哪里，<br>恐怕都无法再躲开她的感知了。|#0201Bad02_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，我还是一边警惕着一边缓缓向后退去，<br>想要拉开距离。|#0201Bad02_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要逃，就只能趁<br>可可的注意力还放在诺亚身上的时候。|#0201Bad02_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（去和其他还幸存的人汇合吧——！）|#0201Bad02_Hiro036| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

